  "title": "Cashew Crusted Chicken",
  "description": "Chicken breasts dipped in an apricot/mustard sauce, then rolled in chopped cashew nuts for a wonderfully tangy, crunchy and easy baked chicken dish. This recipe will satisfy anyone!",
  "authors": [
    "MR_PIANOMAN"
